{"availability":"available","full":"aarizah/AI-Enterprise-Knowledge-Assistant","name":"AI-Enterprise-Knowledge-Assistant","description":"An AI assistant for enterprises that connects internal documents and answers with verifiable citations, safe “no-answer” fallback, and action execution (tickets, emails, CRM). Built as a multi-tenant micro-SaaS with SSO and usage metrics.","category":"Business","language":"TypeScript","stars":8,"forks":2,"created":"2025-09-03T17:22:20Z","updated":"2026-07-04T16:46:01Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://eka-ten.vercel.app","topics":[],"demo":"https://eka-ten.vercel.app/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T17:55:15.507Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-06T17:55:15.507Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-06T17:55:15.507Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T17:55:15.507Z","stars":8,"forks":2}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Production-grade RAG system that transforms enterprise documents into an AI-powered Q&A assistant. Built with modern tech stack: Next.js, FastAPI, PostgreSQL + pgvector, and LangChain.","💡 The Problem: Teams waste 2-3 hours daily searching through scattered documents (PDFs, Word docs, wikis) instead of focusing on high-value work.","✅ The Solution: Upload documents once, ask questions in natural language, get instant answers with source citations. Think \"ChatGPT for your company's knowledge base.\""],"features":["📄 Multi-format document processing (PDF, DOCX, TXT) with smart chunking","🔍 Vector search via PostgreSQL + pgvector for semantic retrieval","💬 Streaming answers from GPT-4 with automatic source citations","🔐 JWT auth + per-user document isolation","📊 Analytics for usage tracking and cost monitoring"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/aarizah/AI-Enterprise-Knowledge-Assistant/blob/main/readme.md","fingerprint":"c1a03a1b02b66fefb13a047e7d014548a4688ede10d5c567035dbf8b272ef7ba","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T17:55:15.766Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T17:55:15.7